A leg of a multisport activity (parentId set) fails before any write. The Garmin Connect web app offers trim only for a single-sport activity, and edits the legs of a multisport activity from the parent.
-- args --
activity
trim
12345002
--from
2m
-- route GET /activity-service/activity/12345002 --
{"activityId":12345002,"activityName":"Bike","isMultiSportParent":false,"parentId":12345678,"activityTypeDTO":{"typeId":2,"typeKey":"cycling"},"summaryDTO":{"startTimeGMT":"2026-01-10T08:42:06.0","elapsedDuration":5474.0}}
-- table stdout --
-- table stderr --
cannot trim activity 12345002: it is a leg of multisport activity 12345678, and Garmin Connect does not trim a leg
-- table exit --
1
-- table requests --
GET /activity-service/activity/12345002
